                                "sense_id": "93433189-b2a7-3925-95a4-d0668a7e05b3",
                                "text": "[…] Brad Schimel wants to make sure women don’t have the right to make their own health care decisions. If he wins, that right is gone,” Crawford says in the ad."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "88bd95ac-09f8-40c0-9f23-afcf986deeec",
                                "sense_id": "93433189-b2a7-3925-95a4-d0668a7e05b3",
                                "text": "As journalist Brad Polumbo pointed out, Kirk previously wrote on X: \"Hate speech does not exist legally in America. There's ugly speech. There's gross speech. There's evil speech. And ALL of it is protected by the First Amendment. Keep America free.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
